<title>CANADA: Shell Canada Ltd Q1 profits rise.</title>
<headline>Shell Canada Ltd Q1 profits rise.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter ended Mar 31.</p>
<p>				1997			    1996</p>
<p> Shr			 C$1.35		   C$0.87</p>
<p> Net			152,000		   98,000</p>
<p> Revs		   1,351,000		1,180,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100)) NOTE: First quarter 1996 net earnings have been restated to C$98 million from C$86 million to exclude the sale of a chemicals business.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100))</p>
</text>
